1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,014
Put your lyrics over a live camera, in OBS or a switcher.

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:08,176
Add a screen, and send it over the network instead of to a monitor.

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,805
Make it transparent, and turn the background off.

4
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:16,673
In OBS, pick the stream, and the words sit over the camera.

5
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:21,101
For a switcher, fill and key go out of one Blackmagic device.

6
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,150
Send. Clear. Obs. Switcher.

7
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:26,568
Episode seventeen walks you through it.
